 "id": "01a0fa0b-35ce-7190-87f8-570c3b521668",
 "summary": "Invoice tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN (refund tax differs: ROUND_DOWN)",
 "content": "Invoice tax amounts are rounded with banker's rounding (`decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`), as decided with the finance team in March 2026. Do not use ROUND_HALF_UP. As of 2026-10-02 finance says refund tax is rounded separately with ROUND_DOWN, so this rule covers invoice tax only."
}
